#. module: l10n_ve_deductible
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_deductible.field_account_move_line__global_deductible_discount_percent
msgid ""
"Exact percentage of the line's gross subtotal removed by the deductible of "
"the document. Deliberately NOT rounded (no digits): any rounding changes the"
" cent of the line subtotal, so the result would no longer match the native "
"discount / discount_fixed."
msgstr "Porcentaje exacto del subtotal bruto de la línea que descuenta el deducible del documento. Se deja SIN redondear a propósito: cualquier redondeo cambia el centavo del subtotal de la línea y dejaría de coincidir con el descuento nativo / discount_fixed."

#. module: l10n_ve_deductible
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_ve_deductible.selection__account_move__global_deductible_type__amount
